    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): the fight's blows and shots chosen in the crate (spec 39 step 8b5-xvii)\n\nFormationMelee.blows is one crate pass over the squads' roster (`fight::choose`, binding\n`fight_choose`): targets cleared, the scrum's search on a sync made in the crate, the\ncooldowns and the morale's interval, the blows on routers and the shots, each blow's damage\nfrom its striker's sheet. It returns [melee blows, shots]; ScrumBlowsField.mark records\nwhether it synced, for the landing's count. The `blows`, `rout_blows` and `shots` bindings,\nScrumBlowsField's search, RoutBlows, ScrumBlows and FormationCombat are gone. Outcomes\nunchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi5grMQjKFCb45uCJxb",
